:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Attala County has 75 years on record, and May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 144% of normal in May to June and 42% in November to December. So far in 2026 it was 40% of normal in February to March. All 8 grids had their driest year in 1952, as low as 58% on grid 15762.</p>"}
